Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.68,0:00:08.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.36,0:00:10.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't turn your backs on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:13.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.04,0:00:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll favor this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.94,0:00:17.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hamon Baby Launcher!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.30,0:00:32.76,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Shijima no soko kara
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.30,0:00:32.76,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,From out of the stillness
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.39,0:00:36.60,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Mezameru sono hashira tachi
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.39,0:00:36.60,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,The Pillars of the past are awakening
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.44,0:00:37.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:36.60,0:00:39.98,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Toki wo koe
Dialogue: 1,0:00:36.60,0:00:39.98,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,To the dawn of a new day
Dialogue: 3,0:00:39.98,0:00:47.24,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Shinku no chishio ga
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.98,0:00:47.24,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,The river of crimson blood within you
Dialogue: 1,0:00:47.99,0:00:53.78,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Tachiagaru yuki wo hikiawaseru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:47.99,0:00:53.78,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Carries with it the courage to stand and fight
Dialogue: 1,0:00:47.99,0:00:53.78,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Tachiagaru yuuki wo hikiawaseru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:54.78,0:01:02.50,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Uketsugu ai wo sadame to yobu nara
Dialogue: 1,0:00:54.78,0:01:02.50,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Even if the love I feel is just part of my legacy...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.50,0:01:08.59,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Hohoemu me de tsugi no te wo
Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.50,0:01:08.59,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll still be smiling as I stay one step ahead
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.52,0:01:06.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:10.38,0:01:15.22,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Yami wo azamuite setsuna wo kawashite
Dialogue: 1,0:01:10.38,0:01:15.22,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Defying the darkness and dodging death at every turn
Dialogue: 1,0:01:15.22,0:01:19.06,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Yaiba surinuke yatsura no suki wo tsuke
Dialogue: 1,0:01:15.22,0:01:19.06,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Slipping past the knife's edge and striking when you least expect
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.06,0:01:24.48,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Tsuranuita omoi ga mirai wo hiraku
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.06,0:01:24.48,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,The emotions running through me blaze a path to the future...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.32,0:01:27.57,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.32,0:01:27.57,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.57,0:01:29.82,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Atsuku like a bloody stone
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.57,0:01:29.82,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Burning like a bloody stone
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.57,0:01:29.82,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Atsuku like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.57,0:01:29.82,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Burning like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.82,0:01:33.66,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Ketsumyaku ni kizamareta innen ni
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.82,0:01:33.66,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,When the time comes to end the vendetta carried by our blood
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:32.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be in love with the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.72,0:01:36.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be in love with the lack of hope.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.66,0:01:39.45,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Ukiagaru kienai hokori no kizuna
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.66,0:01:39.45,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Remember that the bonds of pride will carry you through any storm
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.16,0:01:41.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be in love with you.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.45,0:01:44.50,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Nigirishimete
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.45,0:01:44.50,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,So hold them close
