Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.00,0:02:00.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could this be...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.91,0:02:02.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is this what I think? Nice work!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.96,0:02:06.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caesar may be a narcissist,\Nbut his Hamon skills are solid.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.24,0:02:10.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These bubbles may look harmless,\Nbut prepare for a bombardment!
