Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.20,0:02:21.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.11,0:02:21.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he popped them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.10,0:02:23.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How on earth did he do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.96,0:02:25.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not his hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.40,0:02:27.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those are wires attached to\Nhis head he's manipulating.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.98,0:02:31.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He pumped my bubbles with\Nthe wind that they created.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.60,0:02:35.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then that means they were\Ndesigned to be anti-Harmon weapons.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.76,0:02:39.18,Main,Speedwagon,0,0,0,,{\an8}These monsters already understand how Hamon works...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.76,0:02:39.18,RockBands,,0,0,0,,{\fad(232,0)\be10\pos(363,860)}WAMUU
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.76,0:02:39.18,Main,Speedwagon,0,0,0,,{\an8}These monsters already understand how the Ripple works...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.76,0:02:39.18,RockBands,,0,0,0,,{\fad(232,0)\be10\pos(363,860)}WHAM
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.00,0:02:39.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somehow they're already familiar\Nwith the principles of Harmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.62,0:02:44.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They must have faced Harmon at\Nsome point over 2,000 years ago.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:39.85,0:02:45.06,Main,Speedwagon,0,0,0,,{\an8}...just from when they encountered it two thousand years ago!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:39.93,0:02:41.81,RockBands,,0,0,0,,{\fad(232,0)\be10\pos(1400,860)}ESIDISI
Dialogue: 1,0:02:39.93,0:02:41.81,RockBands,,0,0,0,,{\fad(232,0)\be10\pos(1400,860)}AC/DC
