Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.50,0:03:06.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.00,0:03:09.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These humans know Hamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.96,0:03:14.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought we destroyed all the members of\Nthe Hamon tribe two thousand years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.40,0:03:18.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet, here they are, ready to\Nwelcome us at our own awakening.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.46,0:03:22.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.37,0:03:24.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You killed him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.32,0:03:26.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You killed my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.28,0:03:29.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think losing him high will stop me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.28,0:03:35.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.24,0:03:36.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you laughing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.38,0:03:37.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.54,0:03:41.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You all have memorized your\NHamon handbook very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.96,0:03:43.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You always say the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.14,0:03:46.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was that way when we crossed\Nfrom the western continent.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.58,0:03:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it is that way now still.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.96,0:03:52.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think losing an arm or\Nan eye or a leg will stop me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.88,0:03:54.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you take my friend's life?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.86,0:03:56.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you know how much I loved him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.84,0:04:00.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why we laugh,\Nhuman. You! You bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.24,0:04:02.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ignore him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.15,0:04:04.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're on a quest to find the stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.56,0:04:05.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.47,0:04:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.39,0:04:07.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Face me, cowards!
