Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.88,0:04:14.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're most vulnerable in\Nyour throat and your lungs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.34,0:04:18.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know that if you can't breathe,\Nthen your hormone is rendered useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.14,0:04:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But because I cannot resist\Na worthy opponent, hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.36,0:04:24.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall spare you because I long for the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.82,0:04:27.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,opportunity to meet you\Nagain when you are stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.16,0:04:31.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The next time we meet, I\Nwant to admire your strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.68,0:04:36.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to become worthy of my time so\Nthat I might destroy you with great honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.84,0:04:47.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It appears that he was\Nthe only Hormone user.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.46,0:04:49.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, let's move.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.64,0:04:58.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I just can't seem\Nto shake this cough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.36,0:05:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's the Hormone\Ntraining that's making me ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.88,0:05:01.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.46,0:05:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, he only sliced your eyelid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.94,0:05:09.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The actual eyeball itself is just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.62,0:05:11.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you should sit this one out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.42,0:05:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we've all seen enough of\Nthe Bubble Launcher for one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.56,0:05:17.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch and learn as I take\Ncare of this one myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.32,0:05:18.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,JoJo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.23,0:05:19.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just calm down, Speedwagon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.90,0:05:21.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy is asking for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.78,0:05:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time for me to show off the brand\Nnew technique I've been working on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.86,0:05:25.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.77,0:05:27.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please allow me to introduce myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.08,0:05:29.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Joseph Joestar,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.04,0:05:33.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and these are the hands known for\Ndefeating your mate-son Viento.
