Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.90,0:06:33.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to admit it, but I know\Nthat my Heaven is relatively weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.78,0:06:37.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure I can make up for what\NI'm lacking with these steel clackers
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.28,0:06:40.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if I can just break open your scheme\Neven a little and fill you with Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.86,0:06:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That should even up my\Nhandicap, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.34,0:06:44.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can tell you're nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.52,0:06:46.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.36,0:06:56.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.88,0:06:58.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let us keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.52,0:07:01.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently, the human race has\Nregressed rather than evolved.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.96,0:07:03.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quite an understatement.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.10,0:07:08.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amusing, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.50,0:07:11.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.42,0:07:14.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your child's little games are\Ngoing to get us all killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.16,0:07:17.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's playing coy, but this may\Nactually be the best JoJo's got.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.12,0:07:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'd be fine if he was facing\Nsome common street punk,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.12,0:07:23.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I don't think he realizes that these
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.18,0:07:25.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,opponents are on a\Ncompletely different level.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.64,0:07:28.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would be comical if\Nit weren't so tragic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.54,0:07:31.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why isn't anyone taking my\Nlittle metal balls seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.84,0:07:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's far enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.18,0:07:35.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't make me clack you into the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.98,0:07:36.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.89,0:07:39.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you feel that human\Nlives are short enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.26,0:07:41.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no need to sprint to your death.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.12,0:07:41.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.03,0:07:45.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you've ever had spaghetti on nero\Nde sepia, you know it looks bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.74,0:07:46.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it's delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.00,0:07:50.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should taste my clacker\Nvolley before you judge it.
