Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.28,0:08:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can anything move like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.46,0:08:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe what I'm seeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.10,0:08:30.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's faster than Santana.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.88,0:08:34.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think those idiotic\Nclackers did so much as graze him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.24,0:08:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I admire your weapon, your courage,\Nand your creativity, human.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.64,0:08:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm actually enjoying\Nyour company you deserve
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.64,0:08:47.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,time one minute but only one that is how
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.70,0:08:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much Time I will allow\Nyou to fight the mighty
