Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.32,0:08:58.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wound as a timer your
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.08,0:09:00.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wrist will work well\Nas a timekeeping device
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.42,0:09:02.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you will lose\Nconsciousness due to a loss
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.82,0:09:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of blood in exactly one\Nminute. Show me what you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.82,0:09:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can do human oh this is\Nwhat I often told the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.90,0:09:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,members of the Hamon\Ntribe your life is now
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.74,0:09:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my hourglass measured\Nin blood Wamuu we'll be
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.44,0:09:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,waiting outside now boy\Ngo ahead and retrieve
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.90,0:09:24.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your weapon quickly What\NI'm sorry I'm growing
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.54,0:09:27.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,deaf in this ear it\Nalmost sounded like you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.28,0:09:29.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,said go ahead and\Nretrieve your weapon which
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.96,0:09:32.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would be ridiculous I\Nmean why would you to
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.48,0:09:35.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,retrieve something that\Ncomes right back to you.
