Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.10,0:09:48.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like my clack of\Nboomerang worked pretty well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.08,0:09:51.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't even need the full\Nminute to destroy you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.98,0:09:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's for killing Caesar's friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.98,0:09:56.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's for not taking me seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.12,0:09:59.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's because I'm sick\Nof looking at your ugly face.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.84,0:10:00.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do what you must.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.02,0:10:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I deserve as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.74,0:10:07.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No opponent has ever struck my face, and\Nthis is the price for my carelessness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.40,0:10:11.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall take this beating in order to\Nproperly honor you before I destroy you.
