Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.52,0:10:31.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't even stop to blink when you\Nkilled Caesar's friend, Mark, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.62,0:10:32.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.72,0:10:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you not value life at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.10,0:10:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, watch yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.64,0:10:37.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His arm isn't broken!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.90,0:10:39.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's getting ready to use it!
