Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.92,0:10:46.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.83,0:10:48.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a feeling this isn't good for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.80,0:10:51.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A charming observation, human.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.46,0:10:53.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm now scarred due to my carelessness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.76,0:10:58.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was my duty to allow you to pummel me\Nas punishment for my own lack of judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.02,0:11:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That has now ended, however.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.16,0:11:03.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, finish him now while you still can!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.58,0:11:07.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My ultimate technique,\Nthe Divine Sandstorm!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.54,0:11:10.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't like the sound of that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.44,0:11:13.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He starts by spinning\Nhis left arm clockwise,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.24,0:11:15.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then his right arm counter-clockwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.04,0:11:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo is unprepared to\Ncounter a technique like
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.62,0:11:21.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this as Wamo's fists seem\Nto grow before his eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.56,0:11:29.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The air between Whamu's arms transforms\Ninto a powerful vortex of destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.76,0:11:33.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This vacuum creates a highly\Npressurized, deadly maelstrom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.72,0:11:38.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great, if he can tear\Nthrough marble pillars,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.20,0:11:41.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see myself having much of a\Nchance against a windstorm like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.68,0:11:44.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think I've ever\Nseen anything this powerful!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.68,0:11:50.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
