Dialogue: 2,0:11:51.94,0:11:51.98,SFXSilverChariot,19,0,0,0,,{=34}{\bord0\blur1.2\be1\shad5\4a&HFF&}{\frz13.51\pos(1285.4,144.8)}Fwoom
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.54,0:12:00.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I call that Divine Sandstorm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.98,0:12:02.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.82,0:12:04.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be a damn fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.24,0:12:05.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run, Speedwagon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.56,0:12:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of here before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.54,0:12:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll try to distract him somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.18,0:12:11.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Curse this blood in my eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.92,0:12:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Threw off my aim.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.98,0:12:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it proved enough when you made\Nthe choice to hide behind a pillar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.86,0:12:18.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.10,0:12:20.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You died quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.42,0:12:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Normally, I would ignore human\Nonlookers such as yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.40,0:12:26.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.32,0:12:31.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you witnessed my shame, so unfortunately\NI must take the time to destroy you both.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.38,0:12:33.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may pray now if you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.36,0:12:37.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.88,0:12:43.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, must be the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.16,0:12:50.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does he think he's doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.46,0:12:52.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.26,0:12:54.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's actually trying to escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.90,0:12:59.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.44,0:13:03.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That coward has no shame\Nplaying dead like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.98,0:13:07.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand leaving me,\Nbut what about Speedwagon?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.44,0:13:09.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew he was spineless!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.64,0:13:12.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy is the most\Npowerful foe I've ever faced.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.06,0:13:14.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My breathing is out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.98,0:13:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't control my Hamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.04,0:13:19.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't really have any other option left.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.86,0:13:22.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luckily, my specialty is running away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.92,0:13:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behold, our now broken hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.84,0:13:28.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, forced to play dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.80,0:13:33.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,crawling for his life, and now leaving\NSpeedwagon behind to face certain death.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.78,0:13:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even with all of this, Jojo remains\Ndedicated, a hero worthy of this tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.90,0:13:40.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is that, you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.58,0:13:46.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice try there, human.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.58,0:13:48.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.30,0:13:52.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No true warrior would ever feign\Ndeath just to save himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.96,0:14:01.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That may be true, though my intention\Nwas not to escape but to distract.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.46,0:14:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Truth be told, I was just trying\Nto get you onto this minecart.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.00,0:14:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are clever indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.90,0:14:10.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you were only playing the part of the\Ncoward to lure me away from your friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.86,0:14:11.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.77,0:14:13.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you fell for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.24,0:14:15.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That trick is probably older than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.32,0:14:17.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out now, speed wagon. Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.64,0:14:18.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caesar, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.55,0:14:19.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you guys doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.08,0:14:23.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, that bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.08,0:14:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a noble move.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.54,0:14:28.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I've painted\Nmyself into a corner here,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.40,0:14:31.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to come up with a\Nsecond part to my plan,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.20,0:14:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which would be...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.90,0:14:37.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The unflappable hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.68,0:14:40.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He calmly searches for options,\Nnot knowing what to do next,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.78,0:14:42.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but his will remains unbroken.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.46,0:14:44.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.68,0:14:46.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you, Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.32,0:14:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's in far worse shape than I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.76,0:14:53.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have been the\None to lure Wamuu away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.66,0:14:57.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see now that Jojo only acts\Nfoolishly to confound his opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.68,0:15:01.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must actually have a good\Nplan to beat those monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.88,0:15:12.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although you are quite confident for\Nsomeone who is knocking on death's door?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.42,0:15:15.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must tell you that\Nyour plan is a poor one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.70,0:15:17.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're quite tough, I'll give you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.74,0:15:19.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soft-headed, but tough nonetheless.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.42,0:15:24.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, how do you remain unyielding\Nin the moments before your death?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.42,0:15:28.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it because you have bricks for brains,\Nor do you still have another trick for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.54,0:15:32.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you really want to know?\NActually, no. Let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.48,0:15:34.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because you're so obviously clever,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.42,0:15:36.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give you the benefit of\Nthe doubt that you wouldn't be
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.62,0:15:40.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stupid enough to be holding a\Nstick of dynamite behind your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.08,0:15:41.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, he's on to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.28,0:15:44.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I know you wouldn't insult my\Nintelligence by thinking you could
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.68,0:15:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,quickly throw the brake and send\Nthe minecart flying off the tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.76,0:15:48.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.74,0:15:54.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, he got me there too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.64,0:16:01.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The time on your hourglass\Nwrist is just about up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.10,0:16:06.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is absolutely no chance that\Nyou will survive this any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.84,0:16:09.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found your tricks to be very quaint.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.88,0:16:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before you die, tell me, why do I\Nstill not see defeat in your eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.12,0:16:19.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you if you want, but you're\Ngoing to have to say please first.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.68,0:16:20.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More games!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.59,0:16:21.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've tested me long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.98,0:16:23.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prepare to die! Such a shame,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.02,0:16:28.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because a month from now I can guarantee\Nthat I would be able to destroy you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.52,0:16:31.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.58,0:16:35.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With just one more month of\Ntraining, I would annihilate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.14,0:16:39.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was the first person to hit as\Nwell as the first to scar your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.14,0:16:43.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I put my mind to something, I\Ncan accomplish pretty much anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.64,0:16:48.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, I guess none of\Nthat really matters now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.82,0:16:51.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, can we just get this over with?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.58,0:16:55.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It will be an honor to be killed by\Na warrior like you, blah, blah, blah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.72,0:16:58.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.44,0:17:00.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sick and tired\Nof all this talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.16,0:17:03.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just hurry up and make it painless, Wam.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.52,0:17:04.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Explain yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.60,0:17:06.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to get at?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.34,0:17:16.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how, but he's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.34,0:17:20.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it true that you Pillar\NMen often live for millennia?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.80,0:17:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a long time to be\Nwalking around with the
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.06,0:17:26.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,shame of having your face\Nrearranged by a lowly human.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.44,0:17:29.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems to me that the only way\Nyou could regain your honor would be
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.94,0:17:33.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,by defeating me in a fight after\NI've undergone proper Hamon training.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.86,0:17:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do not have to defeat you\Nin order to maintain my honor.

